pictl
=
-- rpi-media-centre cli --
Usage:
pictl [SUBCOMMAND]
backup [SUBCOMMAND]|manage the backup service
compile [SUBCOMMAND]|manage the compiler service
config [SUBCOMMAND|manage the pictl configuration
disk [SUBCOMMAND]|manage the local disks
help|displays this message
install [SUBCOMMAND]|manage the pictl installer
service [SUBCOMMAND]|manage the provided services
=
backup||_backup_cli
compile||_compile_cli
config||_config_cli
disk||_disk_cli
install||_install_cli
service||_service_cli
=

backup
=
-- rpi-media-centre backup manager --
Usage:
pictl backup [SUBCOMMAND]
help|displays this message
keyfile-s3 (FILENAME)|generate a new encryption keyfile for s3
manifest [SUBCOMMAND]|manage the backup service manifest
queue [SUBCOMMAND]|manage the backup job queue
recover (NAME) (PATH)|copy the named remote backup to a local path
schedule (GROUP)|schedule a group of backup jobs
=
keyfile-s3||
manifest||_backup_cli_manifest_cli
queue||_backup_cli_queue_cli
recover||
service|_backup_cli_service_cli_--restricted--|_backup_cli_service_cli
schedule||
=

